==== C. legacy: a root-owned binary and a LaunchAgent naming it, then one sudo orbit upgrade
$ ls -l /usr/local/orbit-legacy/bin/orbit; stat -f '%Su:%Sg %N' /usr/local/orbit-legacy/bin; plutil -extract ProgramArguments.0 raw /Users/runner/Library/LaunchAgents/com.orbit.runner.plist
